<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 116,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 116,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual receipts 116,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early barrows and gilts traded $0.50 lower than the mid-session Tuesday. Top $51.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				 Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		  48.50 -49.50	   49.50 -50.50</p>
<p>few				     50.00		    51.00</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.	40.00 -42.00	   40.00 -44.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.	43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>	 500 lbs. up	 46.00 -49.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
